# Only the sources the build needs. The toolchain file is left out: the build image already is that toolchain.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!crates/
crates/*/tests/
crates/ui/bench/
!docs/brand-kit/title-select-tokens.css
# Title Select's licence, for the workbench's About page.
!LICENSE
# Retool for Selection: only the files the image runs, which build.py checks against pins.toml's runtime_sha256.
!third_party/retool/pins.toml
!third_party/retool/requirements.txt
!third_party/retool/patches/
!third_party/retool/upstream/LICENSE
!third_party/retool/upstream/retool.py
!third_party/retool/upstream/modules/
!tools/retool/build.py
